    "body": "Not a code failure. Run 45248338661 on `9dfcc7ac2` was cancelled mid-gate: the log says \"The runner has received a shutdown signal\". At 19:57Z an M5 cut-mode script of ours stopped the runner, while the release PR was open. That script is now off for runners, since `cut.yml` has its own `camcraft-cut` label. A re-run of that run (or the next post-merge run) gives the real reading and closes this issue.\n",
